sequenceDiagram
    participant PM as Product
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant Bot as Agent
    PM->>Dev: Spec (.smd)
    Dev->>Bot: smd meta spec.smd --json
    Bot-->>Dev: Outline, open tasks, agent notes
```

